title: "Hyena whoops carry no clan signature under a powered test"
abstract: "A pre-registered re-test of the 2022 finding that spotted hyena whoops identify the caller but not the clan found no clan signal against a proper null, while the same test caught a planted clan signature a quarter the size of individual differences every time. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
